Z||000003||LarryB||02-08-2001||09:54 AM||||If you look closely I think you'll see that the seating surfaces are leather, but the seat backs and the sides of the bottom are actually vinyl. At least that was the case on my style 500's. They're nice too!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P><BR> <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Dan87GT:<BR><B>I just received my Mr.Mikes leather seats on Tuesday, style 380, #8 Grey for my 87GT. They are all leather. I have only installed 1 so far and it was fairly easy. They sure are nice!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>||||reg||3
Z||000004||stsmithgt||02-08-2001||10:40 AM||||Having the back something other than leather is a normal practice.  Less wear, out of sight, that sort of thing.||||reg||1
